# Line endings, decided here rather than per-machine. install.sh is fetched with
# curl and piped straight into bash, where a single stray carriage return is a
# syntax error -- so it is LF wherever it is checked out, on Windows included.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh  text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
